## Original Content
Дежурные средства ПВО с 8:00 до 20:00 (по Москве) перехватили и уничтожили 39 украинских беспилотников самолетного типа, сообщило во вторник министерство обороны РФ.

## Summary
The Russian Ministry of Defense reported that on Tuesday, from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM Moscow time, Russian air defense systems intercepted and destroyed 39 Ukrainian fixed-wing drones over several regions. This operation was conducted by on-duty air defense assets.

## Key Points
- Russian air defense successfully shot down 39 Ukrainian drones on Tuesday.
- The drones were of the fixed-wing type.
- The interception occurred between 8:00 AM and 8:00 PM Moscow time.
- The Russian Ministry of Defense officially reported the information.


